00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:03,500
Americans are "Chinamaxxing" — copying Chinese habits off TikTok. Which are actually real?
{\fs13}I'm your China Travel Expert

2
00:00:03,500 --> 00:00:08,000
Drinking warm water instead of iced? Real — stations and offices keep hot water on tap.

3
00:00:08,000 --> 00:00:13,000
Dawn tai chi and dancing in the park? Real — the parks are busy by 7 a.m.

4
00:00:13,000 --> 00:00:17,000
Early nights, indoor slippers? Real too. But "becoming Chinese" in a week — that's the TikTok part.

5
00:00:17,000 --> 00:00:19,500
So which habit would you actually keep? Tell me below.
